  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YALI - Kamru - GasoPharm</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Over 2 out of 5 Ugandans have a hard time accessing medical facilities, and when they do, medicine can be scarce.In Kampala, Kamru is providing personalized pharmaceutical care along with over-the-counter medications, free health-promotion screening campaigns, and a plan to expand to reach more low and middle income people.</narrative>
  </description>
